{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（28日）下午2時05分，警方及消防接獲多個報案，指屯門建旺街4號利通工業大廈、面向建發里一側外牆的棚架起火。消防接報趕抵現場，出動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊，疏散約200人。經過半小時灌救後，火勢已大致救熄。救護車到場戒備，暫無受傷報告。起火原因有待調查。</p><p>從網上影片可見，棚網陷火海，火光熊熊，濃煙席捲半空，有棚網碎屑從高處飄落；消防正向火場射水，同時亦有工友在平台位置向火場潑水及用滅火筒救火。</p><figure><img alt=\"棚網陷火海，火光熊熊，濃煙席捲半空（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203357527564357632709543.png/Q-EebS9TF60doShV6iJ0SKXNLYzPoEpdZKgsJGSoLCQ\"/><figcaption>棚網陷火海，火光熊熊，濃煙席捲半空（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"棚網陷火海，棚架燒至熏黑。（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203360373936230400839045.png/kqgTirj3KwfNMCD2cgCfQSh0WKlbUaZakMcaQ5DHGkM\"/><figcaption>棚網陷火海，棚架燒至熏黑。（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場火勢猛烈。（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203360728833069056402936.png/G9lKAuUgYJLVtVR5OLo2Q5A3WsIbDTqIJKz5rCSs-aw\"/><figcaption>現場火勢猛烈。（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場火勢猛烈。（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203360731211370496795210.png/TcmyyPx9thkSAHHOKQvtRfJV9w9sY41CAJFqOwCRajs\"/><figcaption>現場火勢猛烈。（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有工友向火場潑水及用滅火筒救火。（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203360565863387136306459.png/iKbbrDmt-ilKD1Zpwnt5TOQ8l_gKPLEZLc3c0C3N3NA\"/><figcaption>有工友向火場潑水及用滅火筒救火。（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有工友向火場潑水及用滅火筒救火。（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203360568132636672968371.png/IFwyaCfvUKSrYBhZ13EMUH-Ldls_n3cQdkbzBHZG8wQ\"/><figcaption>有工友向火場潑水及用滅火筒救火。（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防趕抵向火場射水。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203358000954216448385712.png/ItZifZIn_Rp2gS8SE-CZW9IUgDYe6aU8libR35Ym0d8\"/><figcaption>消防趕抵向火場射水。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"濃煙席捲半空。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203357525299302400942576.png/JTxlLGylfIIdfEMFSLx-DhIhBoFrwvuUBKCCkASggpA\"/><figcaption>濃煙席捲半空。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防趕抵向火場射水。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203358003361878016603294.png/bUFGDFRFh6Decd-kF2ylt2cV_emhXp9L0ygZGdMoGRk\"/><figcaption>消防趕抵向火場射水。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防射水灌救。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203359528213549056675234.jpeg/XkGTXgiekTczpqoH_NNAWtGb3YchfuU-r4Oiba-Dom0\"/><figcaption>消防射水灌救。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>天文台於今日（28日）上午6時00分發出紅色火災危險警告，表示火災危險性極高。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T07:47:10.675261+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":449,"images":10,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T06:37:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:47.702119+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:47.702119+00:00","content_hash":"baa6e6c7e515179ac5b107a7a55bc28a65659708884dd07249d7275852211262","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}